  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Alladin**: back after 28 archived shows (542 days) [3]\n- **Dig**: back after 41 archived shows (808 days) [3]\n- **Bobby Byrd**: back after 40 archived shows (803 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Elanor Rigby**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2011-04-26.dpasax.flacf24** (recommended): source not stated; 12 songs; 100 min [1]\n- **soulive2011-04-26.dpasax.flacf16**: source not stated; 12 songs; 100 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2011-04-26.dpasax.flacf24**: taped by Brian Hadella; transferred by Brian Hadella; source: DPA 4022 (FOB, DFC at Drink Rail, 8' up, DIN) > Sonosax SX-M2 > Sound Devices USBPre 2 > Edirol R44 (24/48) [1]. Also: Taped and transferred by Brian Hadella using DPA 4022 microphones placed front of board, at the drink rail, eight feet up; Transfer from SDHC card to PC, fades in Wavelab 6, then CD Wave and Trader's Little Helper [1]\n- **soulive2011-04-26.dpasax.flacf16**: taped by Brian Hadella; transferred by Brian Hadella; source: DPA 4022 (FOB, DFC at Drink Rail, 8' up, DIN) > Sonosax SX-M2 > Sound Devices USBPre 2 > Edirol R44 (24/48) [2]. Also: Same chain as other copy: Sonosax SX-M2, USBPre 2, Edirol R44 at 24-bit/48kHz, from SDHC card to PC; Wavelab 6 processing included fades, Crystal Resampler and MBIT+ dither, then CD Wave and Trader's Little Helper; this is the 16-bit version [2]",
